	<briefing locid="A modified version of the original, idF! - Kubra Dam provides a MiG-29 and F-18 on each team for fair and balanced dogfights. All vehicles are on 5 second respawns with a maximum of 5 spawns per vehicle. As a bonus, there is no out of bounds on this map, allowing dogfights to take their course without interruption.">map description for modders maps not localized (english only)</briefing>
